<title>NEW ZEALAND: Max says four mln options to be exercised.</title>
<headline>Max says four mln options to be exercised.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Max Resources Ltd said on Thursday it had received notices for the exercise of four million July 1999 options by way of payment of 25 cents per option.</p>
<p>&quot;The option exercise proceeds which totals NZ$1 million will be used to fully repay the company's borrowings against which its Intrepid Mining Corporation NL investment is secured (outstanding principal of A$695,000) and to provide additional working capital to advance the company's international fertiliser business,&quot; Max said.  </p>
<p>The total number of shares on issue following this allotment is 34.02 million.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
